@RecipeApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5099

### Hämta alla recept
GET {{RecipeApi_HostAddress}}/api/recipes
Accept: application/json

### Hämta recept by id
GET {{RecipeApi_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/1
Accept: application/json

### Skapa recept
POST {{RecipeApi_HostAddress}}/api/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pannkakor",
  "description": "Klassiska svenska pannkakor",
  "prepTimeMinutes": 10,
  "cookTimeMinutes": 20,
  "servings": 4,
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "ingredients": [
    { "name": "Mjöl", "quantity": 3, "unit": "dl" },
    { "name": "Mjölk", "quantity": 6, "unit": "dl" }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Blanda ingredienserna",
    "Stek pannkakorna"
  ]
}